==Unlocking==
This Mount ''cannot'' be obtained through [[Items#Crafting|Item Crafting]].

It is unlocked by performing [[Trials]], and progress is only counted when the Mount slot is unlocked ([[Paragon]] 26 or 1e380 [[Mysteries]]).

The amount of progress each Trial contributes varies based on its type. Progress is determined as follows:
<pre>
({Patience trial count} + {Skill trial count} * 0.5 + {Valor trial count} * 0.3 + {Talent trial count} * 0.25 + {Innovation trial count} * 0.1) / 10

Unlocks when quotient is greater than or equal to 1
</pre>

